</span></span><span id="S4.T6.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="3">Multi-World Performance (<math id="S4.T6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>=6)</td></tr>
